## Layer rules

1. **Domain** (`src/domain/`) — entities and repository interfaces. No imports
   from infrastructure or application. Pure Python.
2. **Application** (`src/application/`) — use cases (commands/queries). Calls
   domain interfaces. No imports from infrastructure.
3. **Infrastructure** (`src/infrastructure/`) — persistence, controllers
   (FastAPI routers), DTOs. Imports from domain and application.

